                <mxCell id="sb1_c" value="EngineCore._initialize_kv_caches :248&lt;br&gt;├ ※ register_all_kvcache_specs :1881&lt;br&gt;├ ① get_kv_cache_specs :255&lt;br&gt;│　└ RPC → get_kv_cache_spec :7782&lt;br&gt;│　　　每卡 16 × FullAttentionSpec&lt;br&gt;├ ※ non_causal 扫描 :263（不触发）&lt;br&gt;├ ② determine_available_memory :291&lt;br&gt;│　└ profile_run → available :542 = 2GiB&lt;br&gt;├ ③ get_kv_cache_configs :2073&lt;br&gt;│　├ 合并 specs :2111（同层断言相等）&lt;br&gt;│　├ get_kv_cache_groups :1760&lt;br&gt;│　│　├ uniform :1022 → 本例单 G0&lt;br&gt;│　│　└ hybrid: unify page :1070 / 切组 :1140&lt;br&gt;│　├ 投影 _project_to_worker :2031&lt;br&gt;│　├ config_from_groups :1340&lt;br&gt;│　│　　（按列切张量 ＋ shared_by）&lt;br&gt;│　├ num_blocks get_num_blocks :993&lt;br&gt;│　├ 预算校验 :751&lt;br&gt;│　└ min 对齐 :2191-2192（本例 no-op）&lt;br&gt;├ ④ initialize_from_config :329/:118&lt;br&gt;│　├ WorkerWrapper 按 rank :321-325&lt;br&gt;│　├ GPUWorker :649 → num_gpu_blocks&lt;br&gt;│　├ initialize_kv_cache :7606&lt;br&gt;│　│　├ 4a int8 池 :7286&lt;br&gt;│　│　├ 4b reshape :7346（attn_utils:212）&lt;br&gt;│　│　└ 4c bind :450&lt;br&gt;│　└ compile_or_warm_up :678（4d）&lt;br&gt;└ ⑤ Scheduler :158 → KVCacheManager :271&lt;br&gt;　　→ Coordinator(L4) → BlockPool(L2)&lt;br&gt;　　　+ FullAttentionManager(L3)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#333333;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fontFamily=Courier New;verticalAlign=top;" parent="1" vertex="1">
